  <p>If you have simple, routine questions: We have condensed our 40+ years of disc-stack centrifuge experience into <a href="/disc-stack-centrifuge-faq/">101 Frequently Asked Questions about Disc Stack Centrifuges</a>!</p>

  <h2 id="centrifuges-for-cider-or-juice-clarification-63f782c1-34bf-4217-adeb-40b68078f1b4">Alfa Laval Cider and Juice Design History</h2>

  <p>Alfa Laval designed its disc centrifuges for cider and juice clarification. High separation efficiency is attained due to the very high g-force exerted by the centrifuge. Mechanical separation also removes the need for manual filter changes, saving labor and filter media.</p>

  <h2 id="beer-and-wine-centrifuges-for-sale-1341b486-2003-485a-8844-3ce1dd4196f1">Alfa Laval BRPX and VNPX Centrifuges for Sale</h2>

  <p>The following Alfa Laval centrifuges, originally designed for beer, wine, cider, and juice clarification, are available from Dolphin Centrifuge. Each one is a used Alfa Laval disc stack machine with stainless steel wetted parts that we remanufacture, test-run, and warranty at our Warren, Michigan shop, then mount on a Dolphin-engineered skid with controls and piping.</p>

